{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_05_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "b9db320033f03db7efe2eebc26e370f6599e8934b11a2e58739c503eedfa1ca4", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと真美ちゃん！？\nその話、今は関係ないでしょ！", "zh": "等、等等一下，真美！？\n这件事现在没关系吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_05_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "642e0137e72f42c51325673e8ab3b9e3be379ca64e496c3f984d04475387120c", "ja": "莉緒さん……その話、詳しく聞かせてください！", "zh": "莉绪姐……请详细跟我说说这件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
