{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_05_1050_012mam", "source_sha256": "442b345dbd37d4e73fe961a70fd2b916591264c23ac763821aeaf87b69c70763", "ja": "あーっ！　りおっちが逃げたー！\n待ってよ～！！", "zh": "啊——！莉绪亲逃跑了——！\n等等我～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
